# IPv6 support TODO

- Detect provider IPv6 prefix and gateway on the Proxmox host.
- Add `HOMELAB_IPV6_MODE=disabled|static|slaac|routed-prefix` later.
- Add `HOMELAB_IPV6_PREFIX`, `HOMELAB_IPV6_GATEWAY`, and per-LXC IPv6 suffix variables.
- Have `ensure_lxc()` to append `ip6=...` and `gw6=...` only when enabled.
- Add IPv6 forwarding sysctls on host only when enabled.
- Add `ip6tables`/`nftables` firewall rules.
- Add `dnsmasq` Router Advertisement or DHCPv6 support if required.
- Add Docker IPv6 subnet config only when enabled.
- Add tests proving IPv4-only installs do not emit AAAA-only failure paths.
